  "description": "MUVVOQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H140 La4 N10 O21,0.5(C7 H16). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.739-4.053 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.65-118.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La4O(O2CNiPr2)10]·0.5(C7H16).",
